cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "su_multi_arm: configurable multi-arm retrieval with typed scope, provenance and contract-checked answers"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "su_multi_arm contributors"
version: "2.0.0a2"
date-released: "2026-11-04"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Taranjeet-SU/su_multiarm"
url: "https://taranjeet-su.github.io/su_multiarm/"
abstract: >-
  A Python package for retrieval across several arms (dense, lexical, structured aggregates,
  entity graph, communities, exact identifiers) on configurable backends, with a decision agent,
  deterministic selection, an optional review stage and an answer contract that refuses claims the
  evidence cannot support.
keywords:
  - information retrieval
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - hybrid search
  - knowledge graph
  - provenance
